            <h3 class="section-title" style="font-size: 16pt;">Belonging to a fraternity or sorority increases one's chance of completing a degree with <span data-field="percentage_degree_completion">{{ percentage_degree_completion }}</span> of Greeks graduating versus <span data-field="percentage_non_greek_completion">{{ percentage_non_greek_completion }}</span> of non-Greeks.</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 15px;">EWU has <span data-field="number_sororities">{{ number_sororities }}</span> sororities and <span data-field="number_fraternities">{{ number_fraternities }}</span> fraternities, aligning with <span data-field="number_councils">{{ number_councils }}</span> different councils.</p>
            <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 15px;">Interested in bringing a NPHC organization to EWU? Contact us at <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span>!</p>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <div style="font-size: 80pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">&#x2728;</div>
            <h2 style="font-size: 36pt; margin: 0;">GREEK LIFE</h2>
            <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
                <p style="font-size: 11pt;">EWU's Greek Community donates more than <span data-field="donation_hours">{{ donation_hours }}</span> hours of volunteer service each year.</p>
                <p style="font-size: 11pt;">EWU's fraternities and sororities raised more than <span data-field="donation_amount">{{ donation_amount }}</span> to support charitable causes.</p>
                <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Less than <span data-field="percentage_dues">{{ percentage_dues }}</span> of an average student's expenses go toward fraternity/sorority dues.</p>
