<div class="page">
    <h2 class="section-title">DIVERSIFIED GREEK COUNCIL</h2>
    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">FRATERNITIES & SORORITIES</h3>
    <div class="body-text">
        <p>Fraternities and sororities affiliated with the <span data-field="council_name">{{ council_name }}</span> often engage in a membership intake process semi-annually. If you are interested in a sorority or fraternity connected to the Diversified Greek Council, it is important to be on the lookout for their events. Introduce yourself when they are tabling or reach out to them based on the contact information listed in this booklet. Like all of our organizations, they are always looking for values based members to help them move their organizations and fraternal community forward.</p>
        <p>Contact <span data-field="contact_email_dgc">{{ contact_email_dgc }}</span> for any questions.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">*All chapter dues are approximate. Please contact the chapter directly for an official financial breakdown.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="divider" style="margin-top: 40px;"></div>

    <h3 class="section-title">FRATERNITIES</h3>

    <h4 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px;">LAMBDA THETA PHI</h4>
    <div class="body-text" style="font-size: 11pt;">
        <p>NATIONAL FOUNDING: <span data-field="lambda_theta_phi_founding_year">{{ lambda_theta_phi_founding_year }}</span></p>
        <p>LOCAL FOUNDING: <span data-field="lambda_theta_phi_local_founding_year">{{ lambda_theta_phi_local_founding_year }}</span></p>
        <p>PHILANTHROPY: <span data-field="lambda_theta_phi_philanthropy">{{ lambda_theta_phi_philanthropy }}</span></p>
        <p>COLORS: <span data-field="lambda_theta_phi_colors">{{ lambda_theta_phi_colors }}</span></p>
        <p>FLOWER | SYMBOL: <span data-field="lambda_theta_phi_flower_symbol">{{ lambda_theta_phi_flower_symbol }}</span></p>
        <p>NATIONAL WEBSITE: <span data-field="lambda_theta_phi_website">{{ lambda_theta_phi_website }}</span></p>
        <p>INSTAGRAM: <span data-field="lambda_theta_phi_instagram">{{ lambda_theta_phi_instagram }}</span></p>
        <p>GPA REQUIREMENT: <span data-field="lambda_theta_phi_gpa_requirement">{{ lambda_theta_phi_gpa_requirement }}</span></p>
        <p>CHAPTER DUES: <span data-field="lambda_theta_phi_dues">{{ lambda_theta_phi_dues }}</span></p>
        <p>CONTACT INFO: <span data-field="lambda_theta_phi_contact_info">{{ lambda_theta_phi_contact_info }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 10px;">
        <img src="placeholder_logo_lambda.png" alt="Lambda Theta Phi Logo" style="width: 150px;">
    </div>

    <h4 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px;">OMEGA DELTA PHI</h4>
    <div class="body-text" style="font-size: 11pt;">
        <p>NATIONAL FOUNDING: <span data-field="omega_delta_phi_founding_year">{{ omega_delta_phi_founding_year }}</span></p>
        <p>LOCAL FOUNDING: <span data-field="omega_delta_phi_local_founding_year">{{ omega_delta_phi_local_founding_year }}</span></p>
        <p>PHILANTHROPY: <span data-field="omega_delta_phi_philanthropy">{{ omega_delta_phi_philanthropy }}</span></p>
