    <div class="section-title">PANHELLENIC</div>
    <div class="paragraph">
        Sororities affiliated with the Panhellenic Council participate in a primary recruitment process. Primary recruitment takes place in Fall quarter. We encourage those interested in joining a Panhellenic sorority to participate in the primary process so they can get to know each chapter and make an informed decision. There is a <span data-field="panhellenic_fee">{{ panhellenic_fee }}</span> to participate in the primary recruitment process. This cost covers food and t-shirt during recruitment. To sign up for primary recruitment, visit <span data-field="panhellenic_website">{{ panhellenic_website }}</span>.
    </div>
    <div class="paragraph">
        *Chapter dues are approximate. Contact chapter for more detailed financial information.
    </div>
    <div class="paragraph">
